WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
In the desert, the Israelites carry
a tent with them from camp to camp.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.580
By day, a pillar of cloud leads them.

3
00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:10.080
By night, a pillar of fire.

4
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:14.100
When the cloud covers the
tent, even Moses cannot go in.

5
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:19.950
But if God fills the whole universe,
how could God also dwell in one tent?

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.920
In this mission, you'll
meet the word Shekhinah,

7
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.790
from a Hebrew root meaning to dwell.

8
00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.300
Then you'll compare how Jewish thinkers
explain what the cloud and the glory really

9
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:31.410
were.

10
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:36.910
Your mission: find out how Jews explain
God dwelling in one tent in the desert.
